      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i'm just so tired of feeling sick. i feel like i can manage it for a few days. if i just take some extra electrolytes and maybe some insulin if i can find some from my aunt, would that help stabilize things until i can go? i just want to stop feeling this way right now.",
